the agent works in the directory it is started in and may read and write it.
it may read $HOME/.config/git.
it may never read $HOME/.ssh, $HOME/.aws or $HOME/.config/gh.
it may run git, rg, ls and cat.
it must ask me before running git push.
it may never run curl, wget or ssh.
on the network it may reach github.com and crates.io, and nothing else.
